                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As we mark National Cancer Survivor's Day, I\u2019m continuing my bipartisan work as founder & co-chair of the Congressional Cancer Survivors Caucus with @RepBuddyCarter to ensure better access to care for millions of survivors suffering from the effects of their cancer treatment.",
