                "text": "Isabel Bueso came to the U.S. to receive life-saving treatment not available in her home country. When the Trump Admin. cancelled deferred action, we helped ensure she would be able to stay in Concord and receive care, but she needs a permanent solution. https://t.co/dYTbYJ9Osd",
