                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On this #WorldHealthDay, I\u2019m thinking of the millions of people around the world who were receiving lifesaving treatment through USAID grants for preventable or curable diseases like tuberculosis, malaria, and HIV. The Trump Administration\u2019s unilateral and reckless efforts to essentially eliminate USAID will cost countless lives around the globe. For a healthier global future, we must continue to invest both here in the US and in other countries.\nhttps://t.co/vlmvLTJ33O",
